{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:ModelsOfQous.IrreducibleConnection","@type":"LeanModule","name":"ModelsOfQous.IrreducibleConnection","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Glossary","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.CRRealisation","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Functor.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.NatTrans","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.ContinuousMap.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Geometry.Manifold.IsManifold.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.InnerProductSpace.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.ExteriorAlgebra.Basic"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.irreducible_connection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.irreducible_connection","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/irreducible-connection.lean#L43-L57","doc":"**Lemma (Irreducibility of the connection).**\nIn a ℂ quantum observable universe, every instanton connection is\nirreducible, provided parallel adjoint sections embed into global ones.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{lem:irreducible-connection}`\nProof: A parallel section `D_A s = 0` is in particular a global section\nof `Ad(P)`.  By injectivity of the embedding and the vanishing\n`H⁰(M, Ad(P)) = 0`, all parallel sections are equal — hence the\nconnection is irreducible. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:ex:irreducible-connection","label":"ex:irreducible-connection","md":"quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/irreducible-connection.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.InstantonConnection.IsIrreducible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.InstantonConnection.IsIrreducible","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/irreducible-connection.lean#L34-L41","doc":"A connection is **irreducible** if the space of its covariant-constant\nadjoint sections is trivial (at most one element, necessarily zero).\n(Local co-location copy of `QOU.InstantonConnection.IsIrreducible` from\n`QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.Propositions`, which cannot be imported\nhere without clashing with this block's own `irreducible_connection`.) ","signatureChunk":0}]}